# --- Hand-authored enrichment (ACE has no distinct surface form for schema:provider
# vs biz:providedBy — both read as "is provided by" in English, but SoftwareApplicationShape
# requires schema:provider specifically, distinct from the inherited biz:providedBy relation
# already asserted above from "X is-provided-by Y" sentences). Genuinely inexpressible in the
# current ACE grammar without a second, confusing "provided-by"-alike verb; added directly here,
# matching this pipeline's sanctioned small-enrichment-block convention. ---
aiw:novita schema:provider aiw:novita-ai ; rdfs:label "Novita"@en ; rdfs:comment "AI inference platform; day-0 support for MiniMax M3."@en .
